        {
          "text": " Musengwa Katonda akoba ati: “Abantu ab'e Tiro bakoze ebibi emikuzi kamaala. N'olw'ensonga eyo nteekwa buteekwe okubabonereza kuba baatwala abantu ab'eighanga eiramba mu bunhage mu nsi Edomu, baaloba kukuuma ndagaano ye baakola. ",
