        {
          "text": " Musengwa Katonda akoba ati: “Abantu ab'e Edomu bakoze ebibi emikuzi kamaala. N'olw'ensonga eyo nteekwa buteekwe okubabonereza kuba baayiiga baganda baibwe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "baganda baibwe:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Abaisiraeli baasimuka mu Yakobo muganda wa Esau, eyasimukamu Abaedomu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abaisiraeli, baabaita aghazira kusaasira naire. Era obusungu bwaibwe bwaloba kukendeeraku naire, aye baabusiba ku mwoyo enaku dhoonadhoona. ",
          "type": "text",
