              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale nja kusindika omuliro gwokye ekimante ekyezungulwire ekibuga Rabba, era gusenkeenhe ebifo byakyo byonabyona eby'okwewogomamu. Ghaja kubaagho okuleekaana ku lunaku olw'olutalo, era okulwana kuja kuwuuma ng'oti ni kiwunga ow'amaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
